I was hanging out with the cool kids in rec.games.roguelike.nethack when 
Milton.Pope@gmail.com got out a spraycan and scrawled the following:
>  I'm standing on an altar waiting for victims to appear on my ESP radar,
>  when a brown pudding slides into the room.
> 
>  I've tried pudding farming before, but I always seem to kill them off
>  very quickly. How is it done?

Use a stethoscope to find out how many HP they have left, and how many
are being taken off with each hit - you'll soon work out when it's safe
to hit them and when to let them recover.

Hit them with an utterly useless weapon - a dagger that you've engraved
with and let get rusty is quite ineffective, and therefore appropriate
in this case, though I've heard of people using skeleton keys.

